                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is really fun to play when you hit your friend in the face with a knife or an \"ax\" :)\nFor now it's just a multiplayer game, but i am heard it will be also single player. Developers are on the forum very active and it's really great to see those days.\nThe game needs more content, but they are at the beginning so we'll see what's coming.\nThis is a new game that is really fresh because i did not play VR games where you just killing with a knife. A very fun game, you have to try if you have a VR.\nOverall, the game really has the potential.",
